,"name":"James Gaspar De Almeida","role":"Jeune Trans Asso"},{"id":3859344,"name":"Julie Tessier","role":"Cliente café"},{"id":3534961,"name":"Radostina Rogliano","role":"Cliente hystérique Black Friday (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jaSgZ1szsn2zaHbfEY6uQENr6o5.jpg"},{"id":4069954,"name":"Guillaume Soubeyran","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iwjBmSD0LFRaSxS4Xmh7XqAsXVU.jpg"},{"id":2247543,"name":"Claudia Bacos","role":"Activiste","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5jiAWaoBeffsnCp95HYw2AQ8GC3.jpg"},{"id":5018257,"name":"Sami Abed","role":"Chauffer de taxi 2"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Un anno difficile","overview":"Albert e Bruno, due simpatici scrocconi sempre al verde, nel tentativo di imbucarsi a un aperitivo si trovano coinvolti nelle attività di un gruppo di eco-attivisti. Tra inganni, maldestri sotterfugi e sgangherate azioni di protesta, per i due amici sarà forse l’occasione di redimersi e rimettere ordine nelle proprie vite. Dai registi di Quasi amici, una commedia travolgente e attuale, tra consumismo e ambientalismo, con l’esilarante coppia comica formata da Jonathan Cohen e Pio Marmaï e una sorprendente Noémie Merlant.","tagline":"Loro due sono al verde, lei è green"},{"language":"en-US","title":"A Difficult Year","overview":"Compulsive spenders Albert and Bruno are in debt up to their necks. While seeking help from community workers to get their lives back on track, they run into a group of young green activists. Lured by the free beer and snacks rather than by the ideals of eco-activists, Albert and Bruno find themselves joining the movement without much conviction.","tagline":"What's the worst that could happen to them?"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Albert et Bruno sont surendettés et en bout de course, c’est dans le chemin associatif qu’ils empruntent ensemble qu’ils croisent des jeunes militants écolos. Plus attirés par la bière et les chips gratuites que par leurs arguments, ils vont peu à peu intégrer le mouvement sans conviction."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7dgWaMHTtGrIqxgOaVykZetoVE7.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7dgWaMHTtGrIqxgOaVykZetoVE7.png","language":"it","width":1218,"height":650},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w6eNrJABF5ODWiBAQlrUMFoYjzo.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w6eNrJABF5ODWiBAQlrUMFoYjzo.png","language":"en","width":3469,"height":1133},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2tifb73JljrmlzpIXzyfrp7i9hj.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2tifb73JljrmlzpIXzyfrp7i9hj.png","language":"xx","width":4000,"height":693},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6TObEx6i6cmqI7wr1qjm8SCj2ZG.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6TObEx6i6cmqI7wr1qjm8SCj2ZG.png","language":"fr","width":3336,"height":1299}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xi0xLhXNvcZyVqFKCPnYBsLB373.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xi0xLhXNvcZyVqFKCPnYBsLB373.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/teTTgwreGDfroU1A6VJWqoUpJBt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/teTTgwreGDfroU1A6VJWqoUpJBt.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fCapADgYp7RcentPHhVrubtdK9e.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fCapADgYp7RcentPHhVrubtdK9e.jpg","language":"en","width":660,"height":990},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mMSvziWtVwvZ9qLMjvDLfRhCCJx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mMSvziWtVwvZ9qLMjvDLfRhCCJx.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zH2PnaiLRMmD9yzEBoNgQzArG2n.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.or